§ `JSA 19C`

#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19C(1) regulations may provide for hardship payments to the claimant` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19C(1) regulations may provide for hardship payments to the claimant` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19C(1) regulations may provide for hardship payments to the claimant` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19C(2)(f) the hardship payment is recoverable under section 19C` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19C(2)(f) the hardship payment is recoverable under section 19C` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19C(2)(f) the hardship payment is recoverable under section 19C` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `the provision that reduces an award (seam 9)`

#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19 to 19B the provision that reduces an award` `s 46 JSA 19 higher-level sanctions` EQUALS `jobseeker's allowance higher-level sanction`
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19 to 19B the provision that reduces an award` `s 46 JSA 19A other sanctions` EQUALS `jobseeker's allowance other sanction`
#ASSERT `s 46 JSA 19 to 19B the provision that reduces an award` `s 46 JSA 19B claimants ceasing to be available for employment` EQUALS `jobseeker's allowance ceasing to be available`


